    "intro_narrative": "You've docked at the derelict Aegis-7 orbital research station. The corridors are dark, the crew is inexplicably missing, and the life support systems are slowly failing. Emergency lights cast long shadows across the metallic bulkheads, revealing signs of a hasty evacuation. Your primary objective is to extract the station's final classified logs before the facility's orbit decays and it burns up in the planet's atmosphere. To accomplish this, you must navigate the locked mainframe systems, utilize the surviving computational hardware, and eventually access the heavily encrypted quantum data cache left behind by the chief researcher. Time is running out, and the silence of the station is deafening. Find the drive, extract the truth, and escape before the station collapses.",
